      "line": "The fire burns low. 2 new lines in the journal tonight — loudest: European Elder — named and noted."
    },
    {
      "day": 100,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Elena just put down Buffering... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 115,
      "line": "🌿 European Elder — the foragers have handled it 8 days running. They know it now — which parts are worth hauling, which bruise, how it wants to be carried. The village's knowledge deepens."
    },
    {
      "day": 115,
      "line": "💡 European Elder: the village knows more than you do. Harvest it a few more times (0/3) and it'll click."
    },
    {
      "day": 121,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Farah just put down The Algorithm... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 135,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Rafael just put down The Herald... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 140,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Rafael just put down Ugly-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 144,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Rafael just put down Ugly-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 144,
      "line": "🛡️ Rafael and Yara met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 driven off. Yara is hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 149,
      "line": "📻 The producers name it: the Nielsen. Ratings embodied. It fights boring — and the crowd adores it for that."
    },
    {
      "day": 149,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Rafael just put down The Loud Stare... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
